config BR2_PACKAGE_NUUBOS_RGB
	bool "nuubOS RGB lighting service"
	help
	  nuubOS RGB lighting subsystem.

	  Provides device-aware RGB topology, the H700 UART RGB backend,
	  the nuubos-rgbd renderer daemon, and the nuubos-rgbctl client.

	  Devices without RGB capability are handled as a normal,
	  unsupported capability and do not activate RGB hardware.
